{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"So you hide it from everyone and let him know that you found it? That seems...bold.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:29:30.284000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868016960187805727","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"No... I didn't... But there is something...mysterious about him... Just thought he might have an idea is all... He didnt know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:30:19.543000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868017166795014164","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"And yes, I'll try to hide anything dangerous from my friends if there is a chance i can solve it and make it safe.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:31:10.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868017381342085121","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Surely tonight has shown you how that could be a problem--the less people that knew about the murder-basement, the more able she was able to cover it up by murdering us.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:32:05.389000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868017610745327637","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"The more people who know, the safer we all are.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:32:22.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868017682023342090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"Bo grabs one of few bottles remaining behind the bar. He uncorks the bottle and pours himself a drink. He offers a glass to Apgan. \"Again... Tis why i asked Mal.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:33:11.214000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868017886835376148","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"If Malathor turns out to be dangerous, would you hide that from us as well?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:33:20.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868017926962294824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"Bo downs the first glass. \"If Malathor was dangerous, wouldnt someone be hurt by now? All the times he walks the streets people fear him. Has he done wrong to anyone?\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:34:44.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868018278910545950","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"We want you to be safe, too, is all.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:35:26.293000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868018453397790770","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"Malathor is allowed to do as he wishes, and he is allowed to keep his secrets. But a man with too many secrets can be very dangerous, in the right circumstances.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:36:29.539000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868018718670716938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"\"I don't know what circumstances might make Malathor dangerous, and that's what troubles me about him. I don't wish to condemn the man, but I don't have to trust him, either.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:37:07.036000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868018875944566834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"850791288864505896","content":"Bo downs another glass slamming it on the bar. He walks over and grabs his things from the desk. He heads towards the door but stops beside Apgan. \"The trigger to open the secret wall to the basement and passageways upstairs is over there.\" He points to a seemingly inconspicuous location, but describes how to open the wall. \"If ya need some help, come ask me for it, but you know what I know now.\" He looks out a window before sighing. \"And if he knows anything about it... I'll ask him tomorrow when I see him.\"","created_at":"2021-07-23T06:41:21.693000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868019944053411872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
